flowchart LR
  Browser[Browser route] --> Nuxt[Nuxt page and composables]
  Nuxt --> SSR{Server render?}
  SSR -->|yes| ServerUtils[Nuxt server utilities]
  ServerUtils --> GraphQL[PostGraphile GraphQL]
  ServerUtils --> API[Rust API]
  SSR -->|no| BrowserClient[Browser GraphQL or API client]
  GraphQL --> Postgres[(PostgreSQL)]
  API --> Postgres
  GraphQL --> View[Typed page data]
  API --> View
  BrowserClient --> View
  View --> HTML[Rendered page and hydrated state]
